-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §123 מבנה שבוע העבודה: a young-division head
-- who is not a first deputy works an academic teacher's week, the
-- individual hours on the head's work.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-15`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the section gives
-- these teachers the week another section of the agreement sets (§§15, 17 or
-- 18) and changes none of its hours; it adds no hour the law counts, and the
-- week is weighed, where it is on the law's subject, in that section's file.

§ `123 מבנה שבוע העבודה`

@ref akn:art_123
`a young-division head's full week` MEANS `a primary teacher's full week`

#ASSERT `hours of the week` `a young-division head's full week` EQUALS 36
